  "contentHtml": "\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"page-hero listen-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container reveal\">\n        <span class=\"section-kicker\">Title Track Archive</span>\n        <h1 class=\"section-title\">Listen</h1>\n        <p class=\"section-desc\">AFTER MIDNIGHT부터 NIGHTMARE까지. NIGHT의 각 시대를 대표한 타이틀곡을 들어보세요.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section listen-section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"listen-list\">\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"black-night\"><div class=\"listen-number\">01</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>NIGHTMARE</span><span>2029.02.23 · ALBUM</span></div><h2>BLACK NIGHT</h2><p class=\"archive-note\">제작사의 사정으로 해당 앨범부터는 음원이 제공되지 않습니다.</p></div></article><article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"take-it-back\"><div class=\"listen-number\">02</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>PERSONA</span><span>2028.08.21 · MINI ALBUM</span></div><h2>탈환 (TAKE IT BACK)</h2><audio controls preload=\"metadata\"><source src=\"assets/audio/take-it-back.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></article><article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"between\"><div class=\"listen-number\">03</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>WINGS</span><span>2028.02.01 · MINI ALBUM</span></div><h2>경계 (BETWEEN)</h2><audio controls preload=\"metadata\"><source src=\"assets/audio/between.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></article>\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"beom\">\n  <div class=\"listen-number\">04</div>\n  <div class=\"listen-info\">\n    <div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>SENSATIONAL</span><span>2027.10.01 · MINI ALBUM</span></div>\n    <h2>범(虎)</h2>\n    <audio controls preload=\"metadata\">\n      <source src=\"assets/audio/beom.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\n      Your browser does not support the audio elem